content:
Using the provided reference image, extract only the outfit and turn it into a single luxurious, high-rarity collectible fashion card. Remove the person, room, bed, and all photo background elements; make the clothing the main subject, displayed cleanly as a centered product-style outfit on an ornate fantasy card.

Goal: Create a glamorous “fashion costume card” in the style of a premium collectible dress-up game card, suitable as an outfit reference.

Card design: Vertical portrait card with an elaborate gold-and-pink jewel frame, pearls, lace, ribbons, heart gems, sparkles, holographic shine, and a soft pale pink floral damask background. The overall impression should be rare, expensive, cute, and magical.

Main outfit: Reconstruct the referenced clothing only as a neatly presented two-piece outfit: a pale pink camisole top with frilled shoulder straps, chest ribbon, sheer lightweight texture, vertical stripe detail, ruffled hem, and matching pale pink shorts with frilled trim. Do not include the model’s body, face, hair, hands, legs, or the original room.

Layout and text: Add exactly 5 major card information elements:
1. Top name plaque: {argument name="card title" default="キャミプロ"}
2. Left circular cost badge: {argument name="cost label" default="コスト 18"}
3. Right vertical outfit name plaque: {argument name="outfit name" default="淡桃フリルキャミソールセット"}
4. Bottom feature panel title: {argument name="feature title" default="特徴"}
5. Bottom feature list with exactly 3 bullet lines: {argument name="feature list" default="淡いピンクの上下セット / 胸元リボンとフリル肩紐 / 軽やかな生地と裾フリル"}

Rarity elements: Add a large jeweled heart crest near the lower right and exactly 5 star icons along the bottom edge, making the card feel like a high-rarity item.

Constraints: Keep the outfit faithful to the reference clothing, but beautify it into a clean catalog-card illustration. Do not show a human wearer. Do not add extra garments. Avoid modern UI, logos, watermarks, or unrelated text.

Theme Direction: {argument name="theme" default="Oriental Zen Minimalist Poster"}
Style Branch: High contrast and bright
Main Content: {argument name="subject" default="A person walking in a corridor"} passing by a string of {argument name="key element" default="bright yellow wind chimes"}
Emotional Motif: {argument name="mood" default="Light, transparent, summer breeze feel"}
Scenes and Imagery: Bright yellow wind chimes, royal blue sky, jade white pillars, a small silhouette of a person, minimal wind lines
Composition and Space: Diagonal composition, wind chimes hanging from above to create visual rhythm, the person positioned below in the direction of travel
Color Control: Jade white for pillars and base white space, royal blue for the sky and distant airiness, bright yellow for the wind chimes and minimal highlights, dark gray for the person's silhouette; avoid rigid yellow-blue clashes
Lighting and Texture: Clear daylight, clean edges, light grain, paper texture
Aspect Ratio: 9:16
Additional Requirements: The wind chimes must be a visual focal point, the image should be crisp and bright, avoiding complex architectural details.

Goal: Create a cinematic horizontal poster for a daily greeting card themed around Beijing, combining ancient Chinese architecture, futuristic data visualization, and elegant experimental typography.

Canvas: Wide 16:9 landscape composition, dark navy blueprint background with subtle paper texture, cracks, grid lines, tiny squares, vertical technical markings, and glowing circuit-like details. Use a refined high-contrast palette of deep blue, ivory, vermilion red, teal, and warm gold.

Main subject: Place a luminous pixel-art / mosaic silhouette of the Temple of Heaven at the top center, glowing white and warm gold, with a faint red halo behind it. Add thin vertical guide lines and scattered digital blocks around the building.

Typography: Across the center, create a broad flowing ivory ribbon shaped like a river or silk band. On it place the large headline {argument name="headline text" default="早安·北京"} in ultra-thin minimalist Chinese typography, widely spaced, geometric, elegant, and modern. The headline should dominate the poster while remaining airy and refined.

Flowing bands: Surround the headline with layered topographic contour waves. Use exactly 4 major wave systems: 1 red-and-gold wave crossing the upper left into the center, 1 teal-and-gold wave rising on the upper right, 1 teal wave sweeping along the lower left, and 1 red-and-gold wave sweeping along the lower right. The waves should be composed of many fine parallel contour lines, glowing nodes, small circles, and map-like measurement marks.

Information panel: At the lower center, add a dark translucent rounded rectangle card with thin gold borders and exactly 5 horizontal rows. Each row has a small gold icon on the left and Chinese text on the right:
1. Calendar icon: {argument name="date text" default="2026-07-06 星期一"}
2. Sun icon: {argument name="weather text" default="天气 | 晴 34°C"}
3. Location pin icon: {argument name="location text" default="地标 | 天坛"}
4. Quotation mark icon: {argument name="quote text" default="金句 | 愿你把沉稳留给内心，把锋芒留给行动。"}
5. Check and cross style icon row: "今日宜 | 开启新计划 见贵人 远眺" and "今日忌 | 纠结 懒散 拖沓" visually arranged as the final advice line.

Small labels: Add English and Chinese microtext in the corners and sides: upper left reads “GOOD MORNING BEIJING” plus “北京 / BEIJING / CHINA”; upper right reads “TEMPLE OF HEAVEN”; near the right side add vertical Chinese text “天坛 祈年殿”. Keep all microtext small, technical, and poster-like.

Visual style: Futuristic Chinese editorial design, data-art poster, luxurious cultural tech aesthetic, fine linework, glowing particles, layered map contours, digital mosaic texture, subtle distressed cracks, high detail, crisp typography, no people, no watermark, no extra logos.
